        <obo:IAO_0000115>The proportion or number of cells in the large ovoid mass of paired bodies containing mostly grey matter and forming part of the lateral wall of the third ventricle of the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>thalamus cell number</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
