        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the physical magnitude of the anatomical entity that comprises the organism in the early stages of growth and differentiation that are characterized by cleavage, the laying down of fundamental tissues, and the formation of primitive organs and organ systems.</obo:IAO_0000115>
