        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VT_0002444"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the change in morphology and behavior of a mature or immature T cell resulting from exposure to a mitogen, cytokine, chemokine, cellular ligand, or an antigen for which it is specific.</obo:IAO_0000115>
