        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>Trait.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>VT:0001828</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>This process requires recognition of a foreign peptide fragment bound to self-MHC and the simultaneous delivery of a co-stimulatory signal by an antigen presenting cell; it results in the clonal expansion of naive T cells and their differentiation into armed effector cells.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>T cell activation trait</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
