        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VT_0001175"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the shape, structure, color, or pattern of the small sac-like dilations of the distal airspace of the lung; they are present along the walls of the alveolar sacs, alveolar ducts and terminal bronchioles; gas exchange of oxygen and carbon dioxide between alveolar air and blood in the pulmonary capillaries takes place across the cell walls.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>alveoli morphology trait</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>pulmonary alveolus morphology trait</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
