        <owl:annotatedTarget>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the shape, structure, color, or pattern of the small sac-like dilations of the distal airspace of the lung; they are present along the walls of the alveolar sacs, alveolar ducts and terminal bronchioles; gas exchange of oxygen and carbon dioxide between alveolar air and blood in the pulmonary capillaries takes place across the cell walls.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MP:0002270</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


