        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the capacity to change, adjust, or alter processes in the early phase of the response to infection; normally, it is present at all times, does not increase with exposure to specific pathogens, and does not discriminate between pathogens.</obo:IAO_0000115>
