        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VT_0001340"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the shape, structure, color or pattern of the short hairs fringing the edge of the eyelid.</obo:IAO_0000115>
