        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VT_0000031"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the shape, structure, color or pattern of the border of the spiral lamina, i.e., the thickened periosteum covering the upper plate of the bony spiral lamina of the cochlea.</obo:IAO_0000115>
