        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>spiral ligament of cochlea morphology trait</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>spiral ligament of cochlear duct morphology trait</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
