        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the function of or processes in sound conduction through the middle-ear apparatus, e.g., velocity transfer responses at the umbo or incus level during sound stimulation of the tympanic membrane.</obo:IAO_0000115>
