        <owl:annotatedTarget>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the shape, structure, color or pattern of the horseshoe-shaped thickening of the endoderm at the cranial (rostral) end of the primitive streak formed by the involution of Spemann&apos;s organizer cells which, together with the notochord, induces the formation of the neural plate from the overlying ectodermal cells and contributes mesodermal type cells to the surrounding tissue.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ISBN:0838580343</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


