        <obo:IAO_0000115>The proportion, quantity, or volume in whole blood, serum, or plasma of this catecholamine hormone that stimulates the adrenergic receptors and that causes systemic vasoconstriction and gastrointestinal relaxation, stimulates the heart, and dilates bronchi and cerebral vessels.</obo:IAO_0000115>
