        <obo:IAO_0000115>The proportion, quantity, or volume of a serum glycoprotein produced by activated macrophages and NK cells and involved in initiating local inflammatory responses, particularly by its action on the endothelium of local blood vessels; its actions result in increased vascular permeability and induction of expression of adhesion molecules on the endothelium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
