        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>spleen cell apoptosis</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>Trait.ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>VT:0009340</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Splenocytes can be any one of the different white blood cell types in the spleen. Splenocyte is a vague term, but this name is seen many references as such and is not explained futher, necessitating a need for this terminology.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>splenocyte apoptosis trait</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
