        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VT_0011223"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the deposition or aggregation of coloring matter in the tip of a toe of an ungulate mammal, strengthened by a thick horny (keratin) covering. The hoof consists of a hard or rubber sole and a hard wall formed by a thick nail rolled around the tip of the toe.</obo:IAO_0000115>
