        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the deposition or aggregation of coloring matter in the tip of a toe of an ungulate mammal, strengthened by a thick horny (keratin) covering. The hoof consists of a hard or rubber sole and a hard wall formed by a thick nail rolled around the tip of the toe.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UBERON:0008963</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hoof</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
