        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VT_0010632"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any measurable or observable characteristic related to the chemical reactions and pathways involving glucose, the aldohexose gluco-hexose. D-glucose is dextrorotatory and is sometimes known as dextrose; it is an important source of energy for living organisms and is found free as well as combined in homo- and hetero-oligosaccharides and polysaccharides.</obo:IAO_0000115>
